@products = http://localhost:5101/api/products
@inventory = http://localhost:5102/api/inventory
@orders = http://localhost:5103/api/orders
@skuSuffix = change-before-each-demo
@firstProductId = paste-first-product-id
@secondProductId = paste-second-product-id
@orderKey = replace-with-a-new-guid
@rejectedKey = replace-with-another-new-guid
@receiptId = replace-with-a-third-new-guid
@confirmedOrderId = paste-confirmed-order-id
@rejectedOrderId = paste-rejected-order-id

# All API responses include X-Malaysia-Time in ISO 8601 with +08:00.
# Standard Date remains GMT; stored AtUtc fields remain UTC.

### Create first product (201); copy response id into firstProductId
POST {{products}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"sku":"MOUSE-{{skuSuffix}}","name":"Wireless Mouse","unitPrice":25.50}

### Create second product (201); copy response id into secondProductId
POST {{products}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"sku":"PAD-{{skuSuffix}}","name":"Mouse Pad","unitPrice":10.00}

### List products (200)
GET {{products}}

### Search active catalogue products before pagination (200); Active does not imply stock availability
GET {{products}}?search=mouse&isActive=true&offset=0&limit=20

### Recent saved order activity (200); read-only, newest first, no global metrics implied
GET {{orders}}?newestFirst=true&offset=0&limit=20

### Initialise first stock count (200)
PUT {{inventory}}/{{firstProductId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"onHand":20,"reason":"Opening stock count"}

### Initialise second stock count (200)
PUT {{inventory}}/{{secondProductId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"onHand":10,"reason":"Opening stock count"}

### Create multi-item order (201 Confirmed); copy orderId into confirmedOrderId; repeat unchanged for 200 replay
POST {{orders}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{orderKey}}

{"items":[{"productId":"{{firstProductId}}","quantity":3},{"productId":"{{secondProductId}}","quantity":2}]}

### Inspect saved reservation (200 Reserved); items contain original quantities 3 and 2, sorted by product ID
GET {{inventory}}/reservations/{{confirmedOrderId}}

### First product: OnHand 20, Reserved 3, Available 17
GET {{inventory}}/{{firstProductId}}

### Ledger: InitialStock then Reserve; order ID is the Reserve operation ID
GET {{inventory}}/{{firstProductId}}/movements

### Reject entire order (409); copy error orderId into rejectedOrderId; no partial hold on either item
POST {{orders}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{rejectedKey}}

{"items":[{"productId":"{{firstProductId}}","quantity":18},{"productId":"{{secondProductId}}","quantity":1}]}

### Read rejection (200 Rejected); original items 18 and 1; original first-product shortfall requested=18/available=17
GET {{inventory}}/reservations/{{rejectedOrderId}}

### Receive 5 units (201); repeat unchanged for 200 without adding twice
POST {{inventory}}/{{firstProductId}}/receipts
Content-Type: application/json

{"operationId":"{{receiptId}}","quantity":5,"reason":"Supplier delivery"}

### First product: OnHand 25, Reserved 3, Available 22
GET {{inventory}}/{{firstProductId}}

### Replay rejected request above: still 409, even though stock now suffices
POST {{orders}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{rejectedKey}}

{"items":[{"productId":"{{firstProductId}}","quantity":18},{"productId":"{{secondProductId}}","quantity":1}]}

### Inspect rejected history again (200); quantities/shortfalls are unchanged after receipt
GET {{inventory}}/reservations/{{rejectedOrderId}}

### List orders requiring manual investigation (200 array; may be empty); status is a dropdown in Swagger
GET {{orders}}?status=RequiresReview&offset=0&limit=100

### Cancel confirmed order (200 Cancelled, or 202 CancellationPending if Inventory is uncertain)
POST {{orders}}/{{confirmedOrderId}}/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason":"Customer cancelled before shipment"}

### Replay cancellation (200 when completed); the originally accepted reason is retained
POST {{orders}}/{{confirmedOrderId}}/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason":"Ignored replacement reason"}

### Reconcile only cancellation (200 if Released verified, 202 if still uncertain); no request body
POST {{orders}}/{{confirmedOrderId}}/reconcile-cancellation

### Inspect Released history (200 after cancellation completes); items still say 3 and 2
GET {{inventory}}/reservations/{{confirmedOrderId}}

### First product after completed cancellation: OnHand 25, Reserved 0, Available 25
GET {{inventory}}/{{firstProductId}}

### Ledger: InitialStock, Reserve, StockReceipt, Release; Reserve and Release share the order ID
GET {{inventory}}/{{firstProductId}}/movements

### Deactivate product (204); existing holds/history remain unchanged and in-flight orders may finish
PATCH {{products}}/{{firstProductId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{"isActive":false}

### Read the currently observed product state (200)
GET {{products}}/{{firstProductId}}

### Reactivate product (204); same-value requests leave UpdatedAtUtc unchanged
PATCH {{products}}/{{firstProductId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{"isActive":true}
